# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Copy this file to `.env` and replace the placeholder with your key.
# Never commit `.env` or hardcode API keys in source files.
#
# Quickstart — Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required for prototyping).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and copy it below.
#
# For production, create and restrict a Cloud API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
